Package: axlinux
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-click, python3-rich, python3-yaml
Recommends: bpftool
Suggests: netcat-openbsd
Description: Mandatory access control with a YAML policy language
 AXlinux attaches eBPF programs to the Linux LSM chain and enforces a
 policy that YOU write. You describe who may read which path, connect
 to which port, or execute which binary; AXlinux applies it live with
 no reboot.
 .
 The policy is plain YAML, validated before it is applied, and audited
 to a persistent JSONL log. A learning mode watches normal activity and
 proposes a starting policy.
